{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id107253532"}, "name":{"label":"Stanbont"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-12T04:40:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12882660041"}, "title":{"label":"Not good for phone play"}, "content":{"label":"I can’t speak to this release’s suitability for an iPad, but it’s definitely not worth trying on an iPhone. The menus get in the way of the playable screen, to the point that the games is virtually unplayable. I’be logged many happy hours  of Stardew play on my PC, but this release is a miss.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id395766105"}, "name":{"label":"_corndog69"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-10T10:47:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12876090440"}, "title":{"label":"Bluetooth controller support?"}, "content":{"label":"The game is great, but controls are not so great. It feels super weird to try and use the screen as a controller, so I picked up a tiny Bluetooth controller to try out with the iOS version of the game. Turns out there’s no “good” way to map the buttons that makes sense. For whatever reason, when I map my interaction buttons out, depending on how I map it, one button is always capable of tossing items out from the inventory menu— and there’s no warning for it. If possible, can there be an update to support controllers added in the future?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
