{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id15513027"}, "name":{"label":"longtime Dodger Fan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-09T17:50:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12873262888"}, "title":{"label":"Buggy"}, "content":{"label":"This could be a great game if they hired people in QA. Several times I have copied items from my backpack to a storage chest only to see them leave my backpack and never appear in the storage chest.  Nice way to lose 100+ void essence. \n\nAnd when you get to the bottom of the caves in skull valley it chides you for using stairs. There is no way to go from the top to the bottom with some sort of elevator system like the other caves. \n\nThe earthquake does not clear the landslide. The blockage near the train station never does open up. \nThe quest in the tunnel never does trigger even after getting the secret note.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
