{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1301073527"}, "name":{"label":"ilovekissingmen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-07T06:09:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12863138087"}, "title":{"label":"Chill game but audio gets all warped."}, "content":{"label":"Yeah so this game works completely fine besides the music and audios. Examples: Walked into Marnie’s shop and it immediately started to distort itself. Sometimes the walking audio bugs. It mixes itself with the audio of the fishing rod and every time I walk I hear the sound of the fishing rods being released. Today again I walked back onto my farm and the Fall OST started playing on hyper speed and skipping over itself. Other than that it’s been really fun playing this game. This is one of my dream games and I don’t regret buying it at all. ✩•˙∘*", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id672034185"}, "name":{"label":"tdubxzx"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-06T20:29:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12861672412"}, "title":{"label":"MULTIPLAYER IS BROKEN"}, "content":{"label":"Can the multiplayer feature please be fixed ?? Every time I try to play with my friend it’s either unable to join or if I do make it in, then it’s super buggy and I can’t even see the person.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25548077"}, "name":{"label":"skipsizemore"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-06T12:18:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12860439348"}, "title":{"label":"Great game until it crashes"}, "content":{"label":"I LOVED this game when it first came out, and was looking forward to getting into it again after a few years. Sadly, the game crashed on me as I was returning at midnight from a very profitable day in the mines, costing me the entire day's progress. A bug that loses progress is simply unforgivable in a game this old. There is simply no point playing a game knowing that it might randomly crash when I least want it to. I have no idea how often the crash happens, but once was enough to sour me on it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
