{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1234552337"}, "name":{"label":"grxciemxieee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-29T20:03:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12833564153"}, "title":{"label":"Get the game. It’s the BEST!!!"}, "content":{"label":"I love this game but there are some bugs with the music. I was playing the other day and it was winter playing the island music, which kind of confused me. But other than that the game is perfect! ConcernedApe is one of the best game developers of all time, and if you’re looking for a cozy game to get into I reccomend this one!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
