{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id166637488"}, "name":{"label":"Rae1877"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-26T18:10:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12821508966"}, "title":{"label":"No way to slow time"}, "content":{"label":"I'm on my second replay. I played for many hours and I have to say this game is extremely stressful unnecessarily because of the time speeding by. This is a -100 as far as I'm concerned. Wylde Flowers is the better game. Players should be able to slow time and enjoy. This has been a deal breaker for so many farming games. Players need to be in charge of time and seasons. Period. Horrible horrible game and music that will drive you nuts.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1670847271"}, "name":{"label":"GarRub🐱"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-26T18:07:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12821500823"}, "title":{"label":"My 3 problems"}, "content":{"label":"I love this game.  I just have 3 problems with it.  You can get bored easily.  I know the whole point of the game is getting away from life in the city, but I think you should add a choice to get a job at a store.  My other problem is there is not enough people.  I think you should add more people.  My final problem is that there isn’t that many areas to explore unless you’re really far into the game.  Other than that this game is great.  Please read my suggestions.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"13"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"32"}}, 
