{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1050210434"}, "name":{"label":"i'm dadish"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-23T12:56:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12809045023"}, "title":{"label":"Can you add some new events and new characters?"}, "content":{"label":"I like this gorgeous game and I spend too much time playing it but sometimes I feel like want to experience something new this year or maybe one day I can go to another village. the game is really interesting but it need to continue improving not just in fixing issues but also in creating content. I hope that one day Stardew valley will have a lot of new events and characters and maybe another village near it 👀, or maybe moving to Zuzu city by the train ? \nI want to think the developers how create such an amazing village like Stardew valley 💯", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
